/** @defgroup lensflare Lens Flare
    @brief Screen-space lens flare for a point light source.
    @ingroup client

    @{
 */

/** Draws a lens flare (textures/sfx/flare1-4) for a light at lightPos, if the camera
    can see it. With isBlinding, the screen is also washed in lightColor when looking
    straight at it. */
void LensFlare_Draw(vector lightPos, float flareAlpha, vector lightColor, bool isBlinding);

/** @} */ // end of lensflare
